> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Rune</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:4050cbb0bd264ab4,"y":n:404305b7b74c3f5a,"causes":[s:"agent:1",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:4066c00000000000,"tick":n:40abe80000000000,"day":n:4062c00000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:4066e00000000000,"tick":n:40abec0000000000,"day":n:4062c00000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🫙 <b>Eira</b> melted sand and found something transparent — <b>Eira's lenswork</b> (Glass) has been invented! <i>A material no one could have imagined.</i>","tech":s:"glass","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4050abb213cb2923,"y":n:4041e23397880335,"causes":[s:"ev:64",],},{"id":n:4067000000000000,"tick":n:40abfe0000000000,"day":n:4062c00000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> tried something with sand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4067200000000000,"tick":n:40ac200000000000,"day":n:4062e00000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4067400000000000,"tick":n:40ac3c0000000000,"day":n:4062e00000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ylva</b> built a hut.","x":n:40501c4a361b4c9e,"y":n:4041a8807a2d8e65,},{"id":n:4067600000000000,"tick":n:40ac400000000000,"day":n:4062e00000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ylva</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:4050400000000000,"y":n:4041000000000000,},{"id":n:4067800000000000,"tick":n:40ac5a0000000000,"day":n:4063000000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with pigment — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4067a00000000000,"tick":n:40ac680000000000,"day":n:4063000000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Sten</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404b8241a972bbd4,"y":n:403dd58d61bce279,"causes":[s:"agent:6",],},{"id":n:4067c00000000000,"tick":n:40acd00000000000,"day":n:4063400000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Sten</b> noticed that things can be counted, matched and made equal. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"weightsBalance","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404aa0c1ca7371b8,"y":n:4042275dd68955fa,},{"id":n:4067e00000000000,"tick":n:40acd20000000000,"day":n:4063400000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🫧 <b>Eira</b> blew molten sand into clear vessels thin as a bubble — <b>Eira's clearware</b> (Glassblowing) has been invented! <i>Windows, flasks and, one day, lenses.</i>","tech":s:"glassblowing","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:405144cfc0097c69,"y":n:40429365555dfb93,"causes":[s:"ev:183",s:"ev:64",],},{"id":n:4068000000000000,"tick":n:40ad080000000000,"day":n:4063800000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4068200000000000,"tick":n:40ad200000000000,"day":n:4063800000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Torv's blaze. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4068400000000000,"tick":n:40ad940000000000,"day":n:4063e00000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Torv's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4068600000000000,"tick":n:40ae280000000000,"day":n:4064400000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4068800000000000,"tick":n:40ae2e0000000000,"day":n:4064400000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Torv's hewer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4068a00000000000,"tick":n:40ae560000000000,"day":n:4064600000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Eira's pigmentwork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4068c00000000000,"tick":n:40ae600000000000,"day":n:4064600000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Sten</b> picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4047bbce13bafc2f,"y":n:40411bb559d74b19,},{"id":n:4068e00000000000,"tick":n:40ae600000000000,"day":n:4064600000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Askheim, believing a great herd walks the night sky, and the living must follow its path is now simply what one does. <b>the Sky-Wheel</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c2","x":n:404a595bb1c37453,"y":n:4044c82c75bceefb,},{"id":n:4069000000000000,"tick":n:40ae740000000000,"day":n:4064600000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:401c000000000000,},{"id":n:4069200000000000,"tick":n:40ae840000000000,"day":n:4064800000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ylva</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404dd4fb16d83884,"y":n:4043b4b5aef3fcc3,"causes":[s:"agent:7",],},{"id":n:4069400000000000,"tick":n:40af480000000000,"day":n:4065000000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4069600000000000,"tick":n:40afb20000000000,"day":n:4065400000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Ask's gristmill. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"mill",},{"id":n:4069800000000000,"tick":n:40b0190000000000,"day":n:4065800000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Bjorn</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:4050ecb46b921230,"y":n:404451740a21b5c3,},{"id":n:4069a00000000000,"tick":n:40b0340000000000,"day":n:4065c00000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4069c00000000000,"tick":n:40b0610000000000,"day":n:4065e00000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4069e00000000000,"tick":n:40b0640000000000,"day":n:4066000000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🟤 <b>Sten</b> coaxed a soft red metal out of green stone in the kiln — <b>Sten's the soft metal</b> (Copper) has been invented! <i>The first metal — soft, but the door to bronze.</i>","tech":s:"copper","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404876a37f31075b,"y":n:4042a97c7db6320d,"causes":[s:"ev:64",],},{"id":n:406a000000000000,"tick":n:40b0910000000000,"day":n:4066200000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Bjorn</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4020000000000000,},{"id":n:406a200000000000,"tick":n:40b0990000000000,"day":n:4066400000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Eira's the school. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"school",},{"id":n:406a400000000000,"tick":n:40b0bb0000000000,"day":n:4066600000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Embla the Rememberer</b> brings in the harvest from Embla's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404c000000000000,"