ght","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Torv's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4074f00000000000,"tick":n:40bed40000000000,"day":n:4074a00000000000,"year":n:404b800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4075000000000000,"tick":n:40bef00000000000,"day":n:4074b00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Idun</b> picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. As Sten did before them. No one decided this.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:40282c6758e1180f,"y":n:404ca268ee3c615d,},{"id":n:4075100000000000,"tick":n:40bef00000000000,"day":n:4074b00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Askheim</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Embla the Rememberer</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Askheim","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404a595bb1c37453,"y":n:4044c82c75bceefb,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4075200000000000,"tick":n:40bf640000000000,"day":n:4075000000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4075300000000000,"tick":n:40bf910000000000,"day":n:4075100000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare</b> taught <b>Idun</b> the secret of Embla's silo. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"granary",},{"id":n:4075400000000000,"tick":n:40bf970000000000,"day":n:4075200000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Vidar</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:4049d21617559837,"y":n:40405b0fdca0a122,},{"id":n:4075500000000000,"tick":n:40bfdd0000000000,"day":n:4075500000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Halvar</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now 